Package: agenttrail
Version: 0.7.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs
Maintainer: AgentTrail <maintainers@example.com>
Description: Auditable local AI agent
 AgentTrail is a local-first AI agent layer for Ollama and OpenAI-compatible
 local runtimes. It shows searches, diff previews, approvals, receipts,
 replay sessions, and reports.
